{"id":"wb-5-342","name":"妙乐寺塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"妙乐寺塔","text":"妙乐寺塔位于中国河南省焦作市武陟县大虹桥乡东张村，2001年被列为第五批全国重点文物保护单位。\n妙乐寺已毁，仅存寺塔，始建于唐，后周显德二年（955年）重修。塔为十三级密檐叠涩式砖塔，平面呈方形，内部空心，底边长9米，高34.19米。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A6%99%E4%B9%90%E5%AF%BA%E5%A1%94","revisionId":91637963,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91637963","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/f5737074b962d86e97bea512.jpg","title":"20260220_Pagoda_of_Miaole_Temple_01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20260220_Pagoda_of_Miaole_Temple_01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/42/20260220_Pagoda_of_Miaole_Temple_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Pagoda of Miaole Temple, Wuzhi County, Henan","width":320,"height":480}}